<title>HONG KONG: Midas Printing posts 1st final results.</title>
<headline>Midas Printing posts 1st final results.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   26.1</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    5.5</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  2.82 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    47.17</p>
<p>    Turnover		     356.77</p>
<p>    Company name		 Midas Printing Group Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  May 2-8</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   May 15</p>
<p>NOTE - Midas, which is engaged in commercial, magazine, newspaper and book printing, was listed on the Stock Exchange on June 12, 1996.</p>
<p>The exceptional item represents the interest earned on application monies received in respect of the company's issue of shares during the year.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 5.5 H.K. cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
